What this licence covers
------------------------

It covers the port's own work in this repository: the game hooks and native
renderer (port/src), the launcher (port/launcher), the Mod Maker
(port/modmaker), the tools (port/tools), the online server (port/server), the
Android app (port/android) and the documentation (docs, port/docs).

It does NOT cover:

- Third-party code under port/third_party and port/modmaker/third_party.
  Each keeps its own licence (see the LICENSE file in its folder and
  port/dist/Third-party notices.txt).
- The launcher's Bink reader (port/launcher/bink_decode.c and bink_tables.h).
  It is ported from FFmpeg's Bink decoder and stays under FFmpeg's licence,
  the GNU LGPL 2.1 or later.
- The patches in port/patches. They modify other projects (the ReXGlue SDK,
  which is BSD-3-Clause and partly derived from Xenia; plume; XenosRecomp)
  and are under the licences of the projects they patch.
- The game itself. No game files, game code, art, audio or video from
  WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2011 or any other game are in this repository, and
  none are licensed by it. You need your own legally obtained copy of the
  game. WWE, SmackDown, Raw and all related names and logos are trademarks of
  their owners; THQ / Yuke's own the original game. This project is not
  affiliated with or endorsed by any of them.
- NVIDIA DLSS. Its SDK is not in this repository and is used under NVIDIA's
  own terms.


